{
  "name": "Speed-to-Lead Rescue",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔥 SPEED-TO-LEAD RESCUE\n**What it does:** Webhook catches every missed call / form lead → logs it to Google Sheets (status `NEW`) → fires an instant welcome SMS via Twilio (under 60 seconds) → AI scores & qualifies the lead (0–100, HOT/WARM/COLD) → sheet flips `NEW` → `CONTACTED` → `QUALIFIED` → hot leads trigger an instant Telegram owner alert → final Telegram summary.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- n8n instance with webhook access\n- Twilio account + a Twilio phone number (twilio.com/try-twilio)\n- OpenAI API key for gpt-4o-mini (platform.openai.com)\n- A Google Sheet + Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials\n- A Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `CONTACTED` → `QUALIFIED` (priority column: `HOT` / `WARM` / `COLD`)",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 3480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4a9d7e83-4b24-4150-baa7-14cd15264d5d",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Webhook lead intake\nPOST /lead-in accepts JSON {name, phone, email, message, source}. Point Twilio/VAPI missed-call events or any web form at this URL.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 740,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a94815d0-505e-469b-8c19-2a9dda32e893",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Normalize + log (status NEW)\nNormalize fields, then append one row to Google Sheets with status `NEW` and empty score/priority columns.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5f856eb6-826b-4f76-8fa1-28003aa0ffa8",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — Instant SMS text-back\nFires the welcome SMS through the Twilio Messages API (HTTP Basic Auth). This is the sub-60-second SLA that rescues the lead.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "13ec01cd-43f0-4e38-8e30-8f342664b732",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — AI qualification\nAI Agent (gpt-4o-mini + Structured Output Parser) scores buying intent 0–100 and tags urgency HOT / WARM / COLD.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e6ee2d41-4a85-49f0-9b03-0d7cccbce2bd",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2120,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 5 — Status flow in Sheets\nSheet flips `NEW` → `CONTACTED` (after SMS) → `QUALIFIED` with lead_score + priority filled in.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "476f485f-f477-42f1-94de-156cabd6c0b9",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2920,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 6 — Hot-lead alert + final summary\nIF score ≥ HOT_SCORE_THRESHOLD → instant 🔥 Telegram alert to the owner. Branches merge → one final Telegram summary. (Webhook responseMode is lastNode, so this Telegram node is the last node.)",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "98dbf52b-2757-4158-bc91-fd1d4e53563b",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
